{"5049580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Neosis Echoes", "steam_appid": 5049580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/5c81ba9f74a8470e12a6377d34c9a5b6.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1196 height=585 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neosis Echoes explores a future shaped by megacorporations, consciousness cloning, cybernetic humans and the price of immortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the hostile planet of Varos, cybernetically enhanced humans mine Echorium, a mysterious resource hidden beneath the surface, while the world is controlled by Monolith, a superintelligence that considers human emotion a system defect.<br><br>You play as Evan Draxell, a synthetic clone of the founder of Draxell Corp, a powerful military-industrial megacorporation. After a 200-year journey through space, Evan awakens carrying fragmented memories of a life he never lived and the legacy of an empire he never built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As he explores Varos, fragments of the past begin to resurface, revealing a conflict that reaches far beyond his own existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/6b63b5e4d519c79a4b0f11d2d9e40f5a.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1072 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/8462eb6fe5a47f309e4d07ff35189131.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1196 height=614 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world affects you. Your emotional state reshapes gameplay. Your actions reshape the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Stress, Focus and Mood to survive, stay effective in combat and exploration, and influence how the world responds to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/6b63b5e4d519c79a4b0f11d2d9e40f5a.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1072 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/500b1d0f50b7fa7f9439cd5213f30898.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1196 height=589 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hostile creatures and machines using firearms, abilities and advanced mobility. Adapt your approach to each encounter and use your environment, equipment and movement to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/6b63b5e4d519c79a4b0f11d2d9e40f5a.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1072 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/993ed724059b4725a9a0dda31cdaba7d.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1196 height=598 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Varos to gather resources, craft tools and equipment, manage your survival needs and prepare for hostile environments. Improve your gear and use what you find to venture deeper into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/6b63b5e4d519c79a4b0f11d2d9e40f5a.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1072 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/6b3fc5249f9ab7cb7fe2bc689f41c97a.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1196 height=585 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across a hostile alien world alongside K.I.T., a robotic companion designed to assist Evan during exploration and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/6b63b5e4d519c79a4b0f11d2d9e40f5a.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1072 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/33659e64272a137ba44bf0cd6c8dca28.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1196 height=643 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remnants of a complex civilization, encounter powerful artificial intelligences and uncover the history hidden across Varos as you piece together Evan's forgotten past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/6b63b5e4d519c79a4b0f11d2d9e40f5a.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1072 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/1655770075e3aeed25115f4eeadd30e2.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1196 height=589 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neosis Echoes is currently in development, and the systems presented so far represent the foundations of a much larger experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to progressively expand Varos with new environments, creatures, machines, weapons, abilities, bosses, resources and survival systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The emotional system will also continue to evolve, giving Stress, Focus and Mood deeper consequences for the environment, enemies, Echorium and the way the world reacts to Evan. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/6b63b5e4d519c79a4b0f11d2d9e40f5a.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1072 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/eefb7201db44f3b74d012012b2690916.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1196 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cyberpunk electronic music producer whose music blends cinematic science fiction, dark electronic sounds and futuristic atmospheres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack is being developed alongside the world itself, helping define the identity of Varos, its environments, its conflicts and its emotional atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The music of Neosis Echoes isn't added to the world. It's built with it.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/5c81ba9f74a8470e12a6377d34c9a5b6.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1196 height=585 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neosis Echoes explores a future shaped by megacorporations, consciousness cloning, cybernetic humans and the price of immortality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the hostile planet of Varos, cybernetically enhanced humans mine Echorium, a mysterious resource hidden beneath the surface, while the world is controlled by Monolith, a superintelligence that considers human emotion a system defect.<br><br>You play as Evan Draxell, a synthetic clone of the founder of Draxell Corp, a powerful military-industrial megacorporation. After a 200-year journey through space, Evan awakens carrying fragmented memories of a life he never lived and the legacy of an empire he never built.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As he explores Varos, fragments of the past begin to resurface, revealing a conflict that reaches far beyond his own existence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/6b63b5e4d519c79a4b0f11d2d9e40f5a.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1072 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/8462eb6fe5a47f309e4d07ff35189131.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1196 height=614 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world affects you. Your emotional state reshapes gameplay. Your actions reshape the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage Stress, Focus and Mood to survive, stay effective in combat and exploration, and influence how the world responds to you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/6b63b5e4d519c79a4b0f11d2d9e40f5a.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1072 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/500b1d0f50b7fa7f9439cd5213f30898.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1196 height=589 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hostile creatures and machines using firearms, abilities and advanced mobility. Adapt your approach to each encounter and use your environment, equipment and movement to stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/6b63b5e4d519c79a4b0f11d2d9e40f5a.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1072 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/993ed724059b4725a9a0dda31cdaba7d.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1196 height=598 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Varos to gather resources, craft tools and equipment, manage your survival needs and prepare for hostile environments. Improve your gear and use what you find to venture deeper into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/6b63b5e4d519c79a4b0f11d2d9e40f5a.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1072 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/6b3fc5249f9ab7cb7fe2bc689f41c97a.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1196 height=585 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across a hostile alien world alongside K.I.T., a robotic companion designed to assist Evan during exploration and survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/6b63b5e4d519c79a4b0f11d2d9e40f5a.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1072 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/33659e64272a137ba44bf0cd6c8dca28.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1196 height=643 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the remnants of a complex civilization, encounter powerful artificial intelligences and uncover the history hidden across Varos as you piece together Evan's forgotten past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/6b63b5e4d519c79a4b0f11d2d9e40f5a.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1072 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/1655770075e3aeed25115f4eeadd30e2.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1196 height=589 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Neosis Echoes is currently in development, and the systems presented so far represent the foundations of a much larger experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our goal is to progressively expand Varos with new environments, creatures, machines, weapons, abilities, bosses, resources and survival systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The emotional system will also continue to evolve, giving Stress, Focus and Mood deeper consequences for the environment, enemies, Echorium and the way the world reacts to Evan. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/6b63b5e4d519c79a4b0f11d2d9e40f5a.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1072 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/extras/eefb7201db44f3b74d012012b2690916.avif?t=1788201584\" width=1196 height=125 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cyberpunk electronic music producer whose music blends cinematic science fiction, dark electronic sounds and futuristic atmospheres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack is being developed alongside the world itself, helping define the identity of Varos, its environments, its conflicts and its emotional atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The music of Neosis Echoes isn't added to the world. It's built with it.</p>", "short_description": "Neosis Echoes is a cyberpunk sci-fi open world survival craft action game where emotions reshape the world around you. Explore Varos, fight with special abilities, survive alongside your robot companion, uncover Evan Draxell’s lost past, and defy Monolith, a ruthless superintelligence.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/6a7c687db8f4f309cd956c0d31a2ae03733bd0d8/header.jpg?t=1788201584", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/26bc6bae82edceac7ae3f36fde5d788c69b8e1a8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788201584", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5049580/26bc6bae82edceac7ae3f36fde5d788c69b8e1a8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788201584", "website": "https://www.neosisgame.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / AMD Ryzen 5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 / AMD RX 6600 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> TBD MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Windows-compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7 / AMD Ryzen 7<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 32 GB MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3070 / AMD RX 6800 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version